hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"24048","Narrated to us Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi, from Sufyan, from Zayd ibn Aslam, from Ata ibn Yasar, from a man of Banu Asad, from the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), he said: No man begs while he has an uqiyyah or its equivalent, except that he begs importunately."
